  "instruction": "Complete the task using command-line or batch-capable tools from Altium Designer, OrCAD Capture, or OpenSCAD. The neutral PCB package `demo.ipc2581`, `nc_param.json`, and `components.json` are on the desktop. Generate NC drill output. Requirements: - Write `demo.drl`, `ncdrill.log`, and `collision_report.json`. - The drill file must use the requested 1-4 span and tool settings. - The collision report must cover the provided component/keepout data. [Software] Altium Designer is available at `D:\\Altium\\AD26\\X2.EXE`. OrCAD Capture is available at `D:\\orcad\\tools\\bin\\Capture.exe`. OpenSCAD is available as `openscad`.",
